 middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, March to April came in under 90% of normal in 44 of those years. In 2025 the middle got 5% of normal in January to February and 2% in February to March. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, and grid 13609 got 20% of normal that year.</p>"}
